[About Utaun Core]

Utaun is open-source. Everyone is welcome to freely rewrite code or create plugins! However, to ensure safe operation and prevent abuse for financial gain, please follow these rules.

■ Copyright
The copyright of the Utaun core and any code adopted in future official updates belongs to 'SiveProject', the software development project including all participating developers.

■ Prohibited Actions
・Commercial use (paid distribution, profit-making activities using this software, etc.)
・Injecting viruses, trojan horses, malware, etc., for malicious use
・Redistributing this software outside of official channels (GitHub: SiveProject) (excluding permitted mirrors)

